---
description: How to work on tasks
alwaysApply: true
---

- Work only on the step I ask for. Do not build ahead.
- Before coding, state a short plan and list assumptions.
- After coding, run `npm run lint` and `npx tsc --noEmit` and fix errors.
- Do not rewrite files unrelated to the task. Keep diffs minimal.
- End with a summary: files created/changed and how to verify.
